<title>HONG KONG: TENNIS-HONG KONG OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HONG KONG OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the</p>
<p>Hong Kong Open men's tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) leads Melvin Tong (Hong Kong) 3-0, match</p>
<p>interrupted by rain.</p>
<p>3-Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat Shuzo Matsuoka (Japan) 6-1</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>7-David Prinosil (Germany) beat Joshua Eagle (Australia) 6-2</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Jeff Tarango (U.S.) beat Andrei Cherkasov (Russia) 3-6 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 6-0</p>
<p>Jim Grabb (U.S.) beat Michael Joyce (U.S.) 3-6 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Danny Sapsford (Britain) beat Doug Flach (U.S.) 6-7 (5-7) 6-2</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>Brian MacPhie (U.S.) beat Carl Chang (U.S.) 6-0 6-4</p>
<p>Carsten Arriens (Germany) beat Andrei Olhovskiy (Russia)7-5 6-7</p>
<p>(11-13) 6-2.</p>
</text>
